"mis", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss": "MISS (subs.):\nI In writing: श्रीमती-।\nII In\naddressing: भर्तृदारिका।", "gloss_language": "sa"}, {"gloss": "MISS (subs.):\nI Loss.: q. v.\nII Error:\nq. v.\nIII Opposed to hit: भङ्गः।", "gloss_language": "sa"}, {"gloss": "MISS (v.):\nI Not to hit:\n(1) मोघीभवति (= be\nfrustrated: q. v.);\n(2) with न पतति (पत्, c.\n1 (= not to fall).\nII Not to attain:\nq. v.: न लभते (लभ्, c. 1.).\nIII To omit, pass\nby: expr. with जहाति (हा, c. 2.); etc. (= to\nabandon),\nto m. an opportunity:\nअवसरं जहाति\nor\nक्षिपति (= throw away).\nIV To lose:\nq. v.\nV To feel the want of: expr. by\ncircumlo.,\nI m. him very much:\n*तस्य विप्रयोग-\nदुःखं नितरामनुभवामिः v. Also anxious.\nVI\nTo err: q. v.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "misal": [{"id": "missal", "headword": "missal", "headword_slp1": "missal", "fold": "misal", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss": "MISSAL: रोमकधर्मस्तोत्रसंहिता।", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "misend": [{"id": "missend", "headword": "missend", "headword_slp1": "missend", "fold": "misend", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss": "MISSEND: प्रमादात्\nor\nभ्रमवशात् प्रेरयति (ईर्, c. 10.),\netc.: v. To send.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "mishapen": [{"id": "misshapen", "headword": "misshapen", "headword_slp1": "misshapen", "fold": "mishapen", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss": "MISSHAPEN:\n(1) विरूपः (पा, पं);\n(2) विकृताकृति\n(mfn.); etc.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "misile": [{"id": "missile", "headword": "missile", "headword_slp1": "missile", "fold": "misile", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss": "MISSILE: क्षेपणीयः (या, यं) (rare), R. iv. 77.\nM. weapon:\nअस्त्रम्: v. Dart, weapon.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "mising": [{"id": "missing", "headword": "missing", "headword_slp1": "missing", "fold": "mising", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "sens