\n(2) स्वामिनी,\nthe m. of the whole seraglio:\nनिखिलान्तःपुर-\nस्वामिनी, K. ;\n(3) भट्टिनी (with ref. to servants);\n(4) कुटुम्बिनी (matron);\n(5) ईश्वरी (= lady),\nm. of life:\nजीवितेश्वरी, Sa. iv.\nII A kept\nwoman:\n(1) उपपत्नी;\n(2) बन्धकी,\ngamblers\nhave m.es in their house:\nभवन्ति गेहे बन्धक्यः\n कितवानाम्, Mah.;\n(3) अवरोधः (when the\nsense is clear), कामपि गणिकामवरोधमकरोत्, D.\nIII. A sweetheart: प्रिया\nor\nप्रियतमा: v.\nDarling, woman.\nIV A teacher: q. v.:\nशिक्षयित्री।\nV Skilled: q. v.: कुशला, प्रवीणा,\netc.\nVI As title: श्रीमती।", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "mistrust": [{"id": "mistrust", "headword": "mistrust", "headword_slp1": "mistrust", "fold": "mistrust", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss": "MISTRUST (subs.): अविश्वासः: v. Distrust,\nsuspicion.", "gloss_language": "sa"}, {"gloss": "MISTRUST (v.): न विश्वसिति (श्वस, c. 2.): v.\nTo distrust, suspect.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "mistrustful": [{"id": "mistrustful", "headword": "mistrustful", "headword_slp1": "mistrustful", "fold": "mistrustful", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss": "MISTRUSTFUL; अविश्वासिन् (f. नी): v. Dis-\n-trustful, suspicious.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "misty": [{"id": "misty", "headword": "misty", "headword_slp1": "misty", "fold": "misty", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss": "MISTY:\nI Lit.: कूहाच्छन्न (f. न्ना) and sim.\ncomp.s.\nII Fig.: गहनः (ना, नं): v. Ob-\n-scure.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "misunderstand": [{"id": "misunderstand", "headword": "misunderstand", "headword_slp1": "misunderstand", "fold": "misunderstand", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss": "MISUNDERSTAND: अन्यथा परिगृह्वाति (ग्रह्, c. 9.):\nv. To understand wrong.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "misunderstanding": [{"id": "misunderstanding", "headword": "misunderstanding", "headword_slp1": "misunderstanding", "fold": "misunderstanding", "headword_language": "en", "so